251 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 209 0 R
/E (    This collection combines AI-assisted composition with human introspection. Every piece started out as a late-night idea, a fleeting emotion that AI shaped slightly and perfected. These are only glimpses of emotion and silent moments caught between dream and thought; they are not absolutes.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
252 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 209 0 R
/E (    The book is divided into eight sections, with combined total of thirty-five plays. Each composition consists of four brief lines that are followed by three closing lines, creating a brief cycle of introspection and reaction.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 209 0 R
/E (    These are not responses. Simple moments given form through words, they are pauses, enquiries, and nighttime echoes of the mind. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
