/E (    Don't ask yourself ambiguous questions. Make it tangible. Take out your phone and ask yourself, "Will me not responding to this email right now matter in 6 months?" if necessary. The answer is frequently no. If the answer is yes, you'll be able to make a better choice and at least understand why this is truly crucial. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
