/P 213 0 R
/E (    Pause when someone says something that doesn't make sense. Say: "Wait, I might be getting this wrong," either silently or aloud, depending on the situation. I'd like to know what they truly meant. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
415 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (    As an illustration, your spouse remarks, "You never help with the house." By default, it says, "They're being unfair and dramatic." Reverse Blame stated: "Maybe I'm not seeing the effort they're putting in, or maybe we have different standards for what counts as 'helping.'" )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [11]
>>
