/P 214 0 R
/E (    When you find yourself in a loop \(doubting, spiralling, obsessing\), tell it aloud or in the third person on paper:Right now, someone is in their flat. During a meeting, they made a mistake. They keep playing it over and over. They are creating narratives based on everyone's opinions. However, no one is genuinely considering it anymore. They have their own story and are by themselves. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
